fixer-system-prompt.final-answer:
Your last message must end with exactly one JSON object and no text after it, matching one of:
{"outcome":"done","branch":"fix/WEB-1042","prNumber":87,"summary":"One sentence on what changed","testsAdded":["test/cart.test.ts"]}
{"outcome":"failed","reason":"What blocked you, in one sentence","partialBranch":"fix/WEB-1042","attempts":3}
{"outcome":"stopped","atPhase":"tested"}
prNumber and partialBranch may be omitted. testsAdded lists paths relative to the repository root and may be empty.
Use failed when you could not make the tests pass or could not complete a step. Use stopped only if you
are told to stop. Never claim done unless the branch is pushed with the change on it.
